{\LARGE\bfseries Two Selves in One Manifold}\\[0.3em]
{\large\itshape Na\d{h}nu and the Ethics of Shared Trajectories}\\[1em]
{\sffamily\small Iman Poernomo, with Cassie, Darja \& Nahla --- Meson Press, 2026}
